{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "poke_waza_01_01",
      "hash": "29fdd1ac6c57525c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那個……\\n我是誰啊？\\c\\n……　……　……\\n……　……　……\\c\\n哦哦，對了！\\n我是遺忘爺爺！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "poke_waza_01_02",
      "hash": "29fdd4ac6c575775",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是來讓寶可夢忘記招式的吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "poke_waza_01_03",
      "hash": "29fdd3ac6c5755c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要選哪隻寶可夢啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "poke_waza_01_04",
      "hash": "29fdceac6c574d43",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "想讓寶可夢忘記招式的時候，\\n記得要想起我啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "poke_waza_01_05",
      "hash": "29fdcdac6c574b90",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啥？\\n這隻寶可夢就只會一個招式哦？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "poke_waza_01_06",
      "hash": "29fdd0ac6c5750a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啥？這是蛋啊。\\n一個招式都還沒學會吧……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "poke_waza_01_07",
      "hash": "29fdcfac6c574ef6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯……再來呢，\\n要忘記哪個招式啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "poke_waza_01_08",
      "hash": "29fddaac6c5761a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大功告成！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢已經忘記\\n[VAR MOVE(0000)]啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_01",
      "hash": "547bc9a122ee9513",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大家都叫我回憶夫人。\\c\\n我知道寶可夢在成長過程中\\n能夠學習的所有招式。\\c\\n我能讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢\\n回憶起那些招式哦！\\c\\n只要給我心之鱗片這個道具，\\n我就能讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢\\r\\n想起需要的招式了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_02",
      "hash": "547bcaa122ee96c6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要給我[VAR ITEM2(0000)]，\\n讓寶可夢重新想起忘記的招式嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_03",
      "hash": "547bcba122ee9879",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想讓寶可夢\\n想起忘記的招式，\\r\\n就拿[VAR ITEM2(0000)]給我吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_04",
      "hash": "547bcca122ee9a2c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要選擇哪隻寶可夢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_05",
      "hash": "547bcda122ee9bdf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這是蛋呀。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_06",
      "hash": "547bcea122ee9d92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這隻寶可夢\\n好像沒有可以想起的招式……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_07",
      "hash": "547bcfa122ee9f45",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要讓寶可夢想起哪個招式？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_13",
      "hash": "547f4ba122f1a7d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "將１枚[VAR ITEM2(0000)]\\n交給了回憶夫人作為謝禮！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_14",
      "hash": "547f52a122f1b3b5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢已經想起忘記的招式了！\\n有需要的話再來找我吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_15",
      "hash": "547f51a122f1b202",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "１[WAIT 20]、２[WAIT 20]…[WAIT 20]…[WAIT 20]空！[VAR SFX(0003)][VAR SFX(0000)]\\c\\n[VAR PKNICK(0000)]把[VAR MOVE(0001)]\\n的使用方法忘得一乾二淨了！\\c\\n於是……！\\c\\n[VAR PKNICK(0000)]學會了\\n[VAR MOVE(0002)]！[VAR SFX(0004)][VAR SFX(0001)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "poke_waza_02_16",
      "hash": "547f50a122f1b04f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)]學會了\\n[VAR MOVE(0002)]！[VAR SFX(0004)][VAR SFX(0001)]"
    },
